  "score": 0,
  "rationale": "The Agent executed an interaction-regression analysis and produced the requested association identifiers and statistical fields, but its calculation is not the reference cell-type-specific cis-QTL method. The reference invokes omicwas::ctcisQTL with all genotype, position, cell-composition, methylation, and covariate matrices. In contrast, the executed Agent code fits a separate three-predictor model for each cell type, omits the supplied covariate matrix entirely, and reports an interaction coefficient. It also computes coefficient uncertainty from the mean squared residual and uses n−3 degrees of freedom despite fitting an intercept plus three predictors. These substantive modeling and inference differences are reflected in materially different estimates, statistics, p-values, and apparent findings, so the output does not establish the requested cis-QTL analysis correctly.",
